  "semantics": [
    "Native 82 attack request writes actor,target,source terrain attribute,target terrain attribute as four words; 0B rest writes actor word. Local authority DTOs are not original wire opcode encoders.",
    "Kind5 uses SetArea for attack selection; other kinds use SetAreaB with terrain99/-99 blocking and four directional propagation branches. Self cell is excluded.",
    "Original ally3 uses GetTeamID and received alliance state; the current adapter requires explicit per-member attackTargets instead of inventing hostility from IDs."
  ]
